     succeeds, there is guaranteed to be room for _N new operations in the in‐
     ternal ring buffer.

     Then, they will submit one or more operations using iiooaatt__bblloocckkffiillll(),
     iiooaatt__ccooppyy(), iiooaatt__ccooppyy__88kk__aalliiggnneedd(), iiooaatt__ccooppyy__ccrrcc(), iiooaatt__ccrrcc(), or
     iiooaatt__nnuullll().  After queuing one or more individual DMA operations, they
     will iiooaatt__rreelleeaassee() the _b_u_s___d_m_a_e_n_g_i_n_e___t to drop their exclusive access to
     the channel.  The routine they provided for the _c_a_l_l_b_a_c_k___f_n argument will
     be invoked with the provided _c_a_l_l_b_a_c_k___a_r_g when the operation is complete.
     When they are finished with the _b_u_s___d_m_a_e_n_g_i_n_e___t, the user should
